guarantee: contract: exit 3 "cannot run" when the file set cannot be listed, never a pass
file: scripts/ci/clippy-lines.sh
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: the status of `mapfile ... < <(git ls-files ...)` is mapfile's, never git's (a process substitution's exit code is not seen), so `|| cannot_run "git ls-files failed"` never fires today; a failing ls-files yields an empty list and ends in the `no non-ignored ...` cannot_run (mutant 09)
--- old
mapfile -d '' tracked < <(git ls-files -z --cached --others --exclude-standard) || cannot_run "git ls-files failed"
--- new
mapfile -d '' tracked < <(git ls-files -z --cached --others --exclude-standard) || true
--- end
